 r←name GetDependencyNamespace config
⍝ Returns a reference to the namespace "dependencies" or "dependencies_dev" (defined by `name`) of the
⍝ project `config` namespace, ready to be passed to `ParseDependencySetting`.
⍝ When there is no such namespace an empty one is returned, which means: no such dependencies.
 :If 9=config.CIDER.⎕NC name
     r←config.CIDER⍎name
 :Else
     r←⎕NS''
 :EndIf
⍝Done
